WEBVTT

00:00:28.503 --> 00:00:31.346
leading cause of death --

00:00:31.346 --> 00:00:35.209
and 75 percent of these accidents have nothing to do

00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:37.494
with drugs or alcohol.

00:00:37.494 --> 00:00:39.755
So what happens?

00:00:39.755 --> 00:00:43.974
No one can say for sure, but I remember my first accident.

00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:47.777
I was a young driver out on the highway,

00:00:47.777 --> 00:00:50.035
and the car in front of me, I saw the brake lights go on.

00:00:50.035 --> 00:00:51.835
I'm like, "Okay, all right, this guy is slowing down,

00:00:51.835 --> 00:00:53.117
I'll slow down too."

00:00:53.117 --> 00:00:55.043
I step on the brake.

00:00:55.043 --> 00:00:57.297
But no, this guy isn't slowing down.

00:00:57.297 --> 00:01:00.475
This guy is stopping, dead stop, dead stop on the highway.